        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-04-21T22:47:11.533Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I hid Thiago after a round, just to be safe, but it might have been unnecessary. Getting a few cards under the Safehouse was pretty simple, even after he broke them all out. I spent most of the game using Comodora’s power to mill Spite’s deck since trashing his Drugs brings them out and flips him faster.</p>\n<p>Mostly, just getting Wraith double stun-bolts (then Smoke Bombs) was what made this less painful than it could have been. Still a slog, but not painful.</p>",
