        "reply_to_user": {
          "username": "_Mad_Dog",
          "name": "“Mad Dog”",
          "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/_mad_dog/{size}/4859_2.png"
        },
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Okay, made a few minor tweaks on my second game, and was even more effective.\n\nDefeated Spite while he was still on his front side!  He only had 3 “Drug” cards in play as well.\n\nBy making minor changes, was able to keep “Dr. Tremata” in play the entire game after she showed up on round 2 (the heroes kept nerfing Spite’s damage ability, so he could not attack the good doctor).  This really helped control the environment deck.  Also, was able to get La Comodora fully set up for her “Harnessed Anomaly”/“Weigh Anchor” super-attack and she buried Spite at the end.\n\nEven more fun game!",
